cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AttendanceKit
abstract: >-
  Role-based iOS and macOS applications for automatic attendance checking in
  offline classes, combining real-time Ultra-High Frequency (UHF) RFID, NFC and
  on-device face recognition.
type: software
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the conference paper below. If your work
  concerns the on-device face recognition models in particular, please cite the
  journal article as well.
